# Optional: enables multi-threaded WASM codecs (SharedArrayBuffer) on hosts
# that honor a _headers file (Netlify, Cloudflare Pages). Not required — the
# app works single-threaded without these. Safe to delete if your CDN
# doesn't support this file format or you don't want cross-origin isolation.
/*
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: require-corp
